# BedLight AI — Mosquitto ACL 템플릿 (향후 사용)
# 원칙: 각 계정은 자신의 역할에 필요한 topic 만 read/write 한다.

# 디바이스: MQTT username = device_id 로 발급 (%u 치환)
pattern write bedlight/v1/devices/%u/events
pattern write bedlight/v1/devices/%u/status

# controller: 디바이스 이벤트/상태 구독, 시뮬레이터 결과 발행
user controller
topic read  bedlight/v1/devices/+/events
topic read  bedlight/v1/devices/+/status
topic write bedlight/v1/simulator/+/events

# db-writer: 저장 대상 topic 구독만 허용
user db-writer
topic read bedlight/v1/devices/+/events
topic read bedlight/v1/devices/+/status
topic read bedlight/v1/simulator/+/events

# mock-device: mock 전용 device_id prefix 만 발행
user mock-device
topic write bedlight/v1/devices/+/events
topic write bedlight/v1/devices/+/status
